<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/39201APPPJQSCBDBPCLLVKSNCLNHTDTRQ> a schema:Event;
  schema:name " Home for the Holidays ~ An Ella Fitzgerald Christmas ";
  schema:description """
	Step out of the winter chill and into the elegant, warm, golden glow of a mid-century jazz club. HOME FOR THE HOLIDAYS ~ AN ELLA FITZGERALD CHRISTMAS brings the magic of the \"First Lady of Song\" to life in a beautiful new concert celebrating Ella Fitzgerald’s most beloved seasonal recordings.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Starring acclaimed award-nominated Hawaiian born Canadian Actress & Recording Artist, LEINA DEBOER, and the electrifying musical talents of Nanaimo's very own JAMES DARLING, this truly memorable evening is sure to leave audiences with a warm and nostalgic feeling this holiday season.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Backed by a world-class jazz quartet, the concert transports audiences back to 1960, the year Ella released her seminal holiday album and captures her signature blend of effortless vocal virtuosity, intimate storytelling, and joyful improvisation. From the brassy, uptempo heat of big-band swing to quiet, fireside ballads, the performance is a joyous love letter to the Great American Songbook.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-12-08T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/616c9981-ab4e-4b4a-bf53-48369ba67e0d.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/artspring/location/403ASKCQMVCSKPPLNQMQPJVVSRPGMSKLR>;
  schema:offers _:6cfb468278f340539e63131aadaca0c98241;
  schema:duration "PT120M";
  schema:endDate "2026-12-08T21:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

