<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/43602ATRSMLLSMTLPPDCDQMRCDPQCTRLH> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "BABY SPACE OPERA (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Perhaps the youngest audience ArtSpring has ever catered for? Foolish Operations’ Baby Space Opera is designed especially for babies aged 6-24 months and their adults, transforming theatre into a playful and sensory-rich adventure. Young audiences are invited to explore a colourful universe filled with music, movement, sound and imagination, in an environment created specifically for them—whilst also welcoming us all to a collective meditation on our place in the infinite universe. That leads to a poetry for the senses: video projections of stars, nebulae, light and colour, and shiny materials in props, costumes and sets, alongside movement and music. This is theatre at its most playful, accessible, and magical.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Created for 6–24 months, these shows will take place in the smaller, less daunting space at Mahon Hall on Rainbow Road; tickets and any questions are via the ArtSpring Box Office. </span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Approx 30 minutes in length.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Thank you to Mouat’s Trading and Nancy Farran for sponsoring this performance. In partnership with Salt Spring Arts Council.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-03-01T11:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/c028bead-18d0-4966-bfbc-5dc25ea047a4.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/artspring/location/408AGTMCPQJCJMVNVRHCBMPHRTBGQDBRC>;
  schema:offers _:6cfb468278f340539e63131aadaca0c98250;
  schema:duration "PT30M";
  schema:endDate "2027-03-01T11:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

