<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/39601AJRRLKSVBMNJSKBSJSPPVNLVSKDK> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "COLLAGE TRAD (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Tradition meets innovation with this musical melting pot of BC fiddle traditions with a dash of swing, a pinch of jazz, a sprinkle of rock and pure folk—woven together to create a performance that feels familiar and yet excitingly new. Combining fiddles and accordion with bass and drums, this is music rooted in community, storytelling, and celebration, inviting audiences into a shared experience where generations of musical heritage come alive. Skilled musicianship, complex arrangements, and a thrilling rhythmic underlay make every performance engaging and joyful from the first note to the last. Whether you’re a lifelong folk enthusiast or discovering traditional music for the first time, Collage Trad offers an energetic reminder of how music connects us across cultures, histories, and generations. 
""";
