<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/31401ACGSQBSNGJMMSMSJDBKPVTCCSKMC> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Eagle Eyes | \"THE\" Eagles Tribute";
  schema:description """
	Step into the golden age of California rock with Eagle Eyes, a tribute to one of the most legendary bands of all time — The Eagles. Celebrating the timeless songs that defined a generation, Eagle Eyes delivers a concert experience that captures the unmistakable harmonies, musicianship, and spirit of the original band.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Eagle Eyes has tour extensively and become the most sought after Eagles Tribute in both Canada & the US. They bring the lush vocal harmonies and intricate guitar work that fans know and love. Every detail — from the tone of the instruments to the layered vocal arrangements — is performed with passion and precision.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From the soaring vocals of Hotel California and Take It Easy to the heartfelt storytelling of Lyin’ Eyes, Desperado, and Peaceful Easy Feeling, Eagle Eyes faithfully recreates the sound that made The Eagles one of the best-selling bands in music history.
""";
