<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/40801ACLMJTSSJPDJLCGJNCRGTMKSPPRR> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "GET BACK UNPLUGGED (AP)";
  schema:description """
	If you loved last season’s incredible Van Django performance then you don’t want to miss this! It’s The Beatles—but not as you know them. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get Back Unplugged doesn’t try to imitate the Fab Four, but rather reimagines—with superb musicianship—some of The Beatles’ best loved classics and little-known gems. Stripped back to their essence, these beloved classics reveal new layers, and the craftsmanship and emotional depth that have made them resonate across generations. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This performance features six stellar Canadian musicians who come from the worlds of folk, Celtic, blues, jazz, and classical music: LJ Mounteney, Andy Hillhouse, David Gibbons, Allan Dionne, and returning ArtSpring performers Cameron Wilson and Brent Gubbels, who played with Van Django in July 2026.  <span><br/></span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-11-14T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/03f66e2f-144e-49c6-b0bb-dcbd24a949ff.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/artspring/location/403ASKCQMVCSKPPLNQMQPJVVSRPGMSKLR>;
