<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/34401AVSCHHTDLGCSLVJRSQLBPTLHDKLB> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "GISS Dance Presents…Year End Show: Ignite";
  schema:description """
	GISS Dance presents.....Ignite<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Each of the grade 9-12 dancers will have an opportunity to shine brightly in this collection of new choreography from the studio at GISS Dance. This end-of-semester show will include a wide spectrum of emotional and artistic expression. The students study Ballet, Contemporary, Jazz and Hip Hop techniques to support their artistic endeavours. The performance will display the work we’ve done this semester. Highlights include a full-group piece choreographed by teacher Sonia Langer to the song \"Cosmic Rain\" by Illogical Post which highlights shapes, formations, and a group flow. Also by Langer, \"Do It Like This\" by Daphne Willis, features quick and energetic movements from the Jazz dance repertoire, and is a lively and moving piece of choreography. Student choreographers are working hard to prepare their work for the stage in small group, duo and solo pieces. The performance celebrates the creativity and passion of these youth!
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-06-03T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
