<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/41202ACSLHGMMTSRKDTPMGGRBGDPBGKDT> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "INTERNATIONAL GUITAR NIGHT (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Since 1995, Brian Gore has been bringing together four international luminaries of acoustic guitar to create sell-out tours—and this season, International Guitar Night arrives at ArtSpring. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This year’s musicians are Itamar Erez, a globally recognized composer and guitarist whose music blends the delicacy of Middle Eastern melodies, the passion of flamenco, and the freedom of jazz; Victoria Ruiz de la Rubia, a fiery and technically masterful classical guitarist from Spain; Cenk Erdoğan, a fretless guitar pioneer, jazz artist and award-winning composer, whose work represents a uniquely Turkish approach to the instrument; and Remi Harris—one of the UK’s most successful jazz guitarists, renowned for combining Gypsy jazz with rock, pop, and blues.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Thank you to Guitars Plus of Victoria for sponsoring this performance.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
