<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/43801ACRLMVKGBSGVDHLHBRQGTPTTSDDJ> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "JEFF NEWMAN: MENTALIST, MAGICIAN, TRICKSTER (AP)";
  schema:description """
	It’s entirely possible that Jeff Newman already knows what you’ll bid on at the annual ArtSpring Treasure Fair... or whether you’ll join him for something completely different at this season’s Treasure Fair performance. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jeff Newman will influence your thoughts. He’ll predict what you’ll do before you even know you’re doing it. He will even read your mind. He’ll fool you badly, and you’ll love every minute of it. For over a decade, award-winning mentalist and magician Jeff Newman has created astounding, engaging experiences that his audiences will not stop talking about. Jeff has been seen and heard on CBC, CTV, Global TV, and has performed to sell-out crowds and rave reviews. Jeff Newman’s extraordinary performances have people laughing, cheering, and gasping as they witness something they’ve never seen before.
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-07-16T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
