<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/41602ACQKSQHLPVVRQGPMQSJQTTRRKTRJ> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "JON KIMURA PARKER (AP)";
  schema:description """
	A veteran of the international concert stage, pianist Jon Kimura Parker has performed in the Berlin Philharmonie, Carnegie Hall, London’s South Bank, the Sydney Opera House, and the Beijing Concert Hall. Yet he is known for so much more than his exceptional technical skill and musicianship: his charisma, enthusiasm, and dynamism fill theatres every time he performs. Having performed for the US Supreme Court, Queen Elizabeth II and prime ministers, he can now add ArtSpring to that list. This rare opportunity to see such a renowned performer in a small, intimate venue will attract an audience from far and wide—one not to be missed!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Thank you to Sandra Heath and Regan Hunt for sponsoring this performance.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
