<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/34001AGQQHTLTHTMBJQGPRQRMLLBGHNMV> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "King, Cash, and Diamond Forever";
  schema:description """
	King, Cash, and Diamond Forever is a high-energy tribute show coming to ArtSpring Theatre this September, celebrating three legendary icons of music—Johnny Cash, Elvis Presley, and Neil Diamond.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Multi-award-winning performers Darren Lee and Jason Scott lead the experience, delivering authentic, crowd-pleasing performances that capture the spirit and sound of these timeless stars.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Darren Lee first steps into the role of Johnny Cash, joined by Jennifer Rae as June Carter-Cash, recreating the warmth and chemistry of the iconic duo. He then transforms into Elvis Presley, bringing the charisma, voice, and stage presence of “The King” to life.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jason Scott rounds out the show with a powerful tribute to Neil Diamond, performing beloved hits that invite audiences to sing along and relive classic moments.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Blending nostalgia, showmanship, and musical excellence, King, Cash, and Diamond Forever offers an unforgettable evening that keeps the legacy of these music legends alive.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-09-18T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
