<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/43201AJDRNMMDNNQTNJHJVCVNCQGVJMVN> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "LENNIE GALLANT (AP)";
  schema:description """
	An acclaimed East Coast singer-songwriter with 16 albums and numerous awards, Lennie Gallant’s most recent album, Shelter from the Storms, was named one of the Top Ten Folk Albums of 2025 by a Roots Music critics poll and members of the Canadian music industry, and gained him the 2026 Canadian Folk Music Awards Solo Artist of the Year. For more than three decades, Lennie Gallant has drawn inspiration from everyday life, personal experience, and the landscapes of Atlantic Canada, which easily translate to performances rich with artistry, warmth, and connection—this is Canadian folk at its finest.
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-04-02T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
