<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/39801ATJCSCVLGHGKQJHSGGHGSRBRSCPQ> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "LLOYD SPIEGEL (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Making his highly requested return to ArtSpring, Australian bluesman Lloyd Spiegel has spent decades earning acclaim as one of the most accomplished and engaging performers on the international roots music scene. A bluesman at his core, a guitarist by trade, a comedian by nature, and a showman at heart, his powerful vocals, jaw-dropping guitar prowess, humour and storytelling create a captivating performance that crosses genres and generations. Combining dazzling guitar technique with soulful vocals and a natural gift for storytelling, he creates concerts that are as entertaining as they are musically impressive. Whether you’re a dedicated blues fan or simply appreciate extraordinary musicianship and performance, Lloyd Spiegel delivers an evening full of passion, authenticity, and skill—every note reveals why he continues to be celebrated by audiences and critics around the world.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-25T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/d3a98e5a-0c97-44a8-b607-fe0159743020.jpg>;
