<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/30001ACDNMRPKSDRKSKCJNMSBQHCSMMMG> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Magic! at ArtSpring";
  schema:description """
	Come laugh and be wowed by three of Canada's best magicians!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>East Van legend Travis Bernhardt, who comedian Dino Archie called, \"the hardest guy to follow in Vancouver,\" has toured his award-winning magic shows and improv comedy shows across Canada since 2008. He also consults for film and TV, most recently Disney's <span class=\"ItalicText\">Descendants: Wicked Wonderland.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rob Teszka is an eccentric, charming, and funny magician who produces and hosts The Parlour Magic Show in Vancouver and tours his shows Magic Dropout and I Hate Magic to theatres and festivals. Rob studied in England for close to a decade, where he developed his taste for tweed and bow ties and earned an Associate Membership in the prestigious <span class=\"ItalicText\">Inner Magic Circle.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Nayana Fielkov is a critically acclaimed, genre-bending performing artist and magician. She is the co-creator of multi-award winning RAGMOP Theatre, Habitats, Underbelly and the Myrtle Sisters, bringing together the mediums of clown, dance, mask, physical comedy, and magic.
""";
