<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/38801AQDNRKLTDJNRGTHNNSDTQVMLRTCD> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Manon (Massenet) (Met Opera)";
  schema:description """
	Superstar soprano Nadine Sierra takes on the irresistible title character of Massenet’s passionate drama, live from the Met stage to cinemas worldwide. Leading tenor Matthew Polenzani is her idealistic lover, the Chevalier des Grieux, with rising-star baritone Andrzej Filończyk as her stalwart cousin, Lescaut, in a breathtaking late 19th century, Belle Époque staging by director Laurent Pelly.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This live cinema transmission is part of The Met: Live in HD series, bringing opera to movie theaters across the globe. Here at ArtSpring, enjoy our surround sound and famous quiche brunch during the intermission.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Performed in French with English subtitles | Please note this opera starts at 9am<span><br/></span>
""";
