<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/33801ASNTMSCGCRRHSPSCJNKGBMBPNMSP> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Prime Minister: Film + Conversation with Women Leading Here";
  schema:description """
	From global leadership to local voices, a film and conversation on women, leadership, and public life. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a screening of \"Prime Minister\", followed by a conversation with local leaders Laura Patrick, Gayle Baker, Sarah Riddell, and Terri O'Keefe. Ahead of this fall's local elections, they will share what it is like to lead as women in a small community, reflect on the film, and take questions from the audience. This is a free, non-partisan event and all are welcome.
""";
