<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/30201AHVTMBBQKSVNPBBRMTKPDQPRMHJC> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "SHREK the Musical Jr.";
  schema:description """
	Stagecoach Presents SHREK the Musical Jr. ~ A Fairytale Celebration with Layers<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This April 2026, Stagecoach invites audiences to leave their expectations at the swamp’s edge and join us for our year-end production of SHREK The Musical Jr., a hilarious, big-hearted musical reminding us that ogres (and people) are like onions… they have layers.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring performances by our Improv, Theatre Seekers, Intermediate Theatre, Onstage, and Performance Dance classes, this joyful production brings together young performers in a celebration packed with music, laughter, friendship, and just the right amount of swampy chaos.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Audiences can expect larger than life characters, energetic dance numbers, and a story that proves happily ever after doesn’t always look the way fairy tales say it should. Whether you love ogres, talking donkeys, or believe life is better with a few layers (and maybe a parfait or two), this year-end show promises something for everyone.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-04-24T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/6c71217e-c9cd-44d7-985b-ff7b7f19bf8f.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/artspring/location/403ASKCQMVCSKPPLNQMQPJVVSRPGMSKLR>;
  schema:offers _:6cfb468278f340539e63131aadaca0c98351;
  schema:duration "PT135M";
  schema:endDate "2026-04-24T21:15:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

