<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/32201AJKCHKSVHJRMVGRPSJQJNPNNBBBQ> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "StageCoach Year End Dance Show";
  schema:description """
	StageCoach Theatre presents our year end dance show! Lights Up! Let’s Dance!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The stage is set, the music is cued, and our dancers are ready to SHINE!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for Stagecoach’s Year End Dance Showcase, April 23rd 6:30 PM<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This high-energy celebration features performances from:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ballet 3–5, 6–8, Jazz 3–5, 6–8 & 9–12 and our Performance Dance classes.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From tiny twirls to powerful leaps, this showcase is a celebration of hard work, creativity, and a whole lot of heart. Our dancers have been building skills, confidence, and stage presence all season and now it’s time to share it with you!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Bring your cheers, your applause, and join us for a joyful night of music, dance and laughter.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Be there April 23rd at 6:30 PM, you won’t want to miss it!
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-04-23T18:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
