<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/34201ASMCSDCJKPKGCLJTKVRDGQJPPMJH> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Bugle Called & Forth They Went";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">The Bugle Called & Forth They Went: <span><br/></span>Honouring BC Black Soldiers of No. 2 Construction Battalion</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The talented Performance Artist, Shayna Jones, of ‘we are STORYFOLK’ will interpret the “Life’s Journey & Service” of twelve brave men from British Columbia. This is a tribute to their courage that while faced with anti-Black racism, they enlisted and served with No. 2 Construction Battalion, Canadian Expeditionary Force (1916-1920). The largest all Black Battalion in Canadian Military history.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>BC Black History Awareness Society and Veteran’s Affairs of Canada’s Commemorative Partner Program, welcome the opportunity to shine a light on this historical contribution of Black British Columbians; our Canadian History.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-06-07T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/0aa94eb2-8be5-42c6-a4c5-067811a66ad4.jpg>;
