<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/41001AMGNGHKLQLCLRMPJKPQBNDVJPHRD> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "THE GINGERBREAD MEN: A HOLIDAY CABARET (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Is this a Salt Spring tradition in the making? The Gingerbread Men are all that is festive: who doesn’t want a little golly-gee charm, buttery smooth harmonies and musical merriment to gear up for the holiday season? With tight four part harmonies, true musicality and a repertoire that spans doo-wop, jazz, Broadway, holiday standards, and acapella, these crooners deliver the songs that you know and love. Joy, happiness and friendliness all bundled together in a cozy evening of nostalgia and life’s simple pleasures.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Family friendly with an age recommendation of eight years and above.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Thank you to Nancy Farran, Kate Merry, and Deb and Mark Toole for sponsoring this performance.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-12-13T14:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
