<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/42001AQJJQTSKLLKMRKNHHDRNVHRLPNPB> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "THE WILDS BY WONDERHEADS (AP)";
  schema:description """
	Renowned for their visually stunning mask theatre, Victoria-based Wonderheads have been delighting audiences around the globe since 2009 with their unique theatrical stories. Transforming the stage into a world of imagination and possibility, they create stories<span><br/></span>that are funny, heartfelt, and universally understood—without relying on words. Charming and profoundly touching, The Wilds is a wordless, award-winning show that features Wonderheads’ signature masks, whimsical puppetry, and enchanting music, and moves its audiences to both laughter and tears. When Wendell discovers that his wife Tilda and their beloved tree have vanished from the backyard, he must venture into the nearby forest to bring them home. Confronted with shifting landscapes, unusual creatures, and a mysterious lurking presence, Wendell soon learns that the key to finding Tilda is to first unlock the mystery of The Wilds.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Recommended for ages eight and above | Approx 60 minutes (no intermission).</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Thank you to Mouat’s Clothing for sponsoring this performance.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-02-18T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/bcf662fa-fec2-4a7e-9ad1-86164f3f598c.jpg>;
