<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/27001AHPHSDCGHGCCRQCHCPMCLLSSSQJG> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "THEATRE DEVISING WITH MEMORY AND ANCESTRY (Workshop)";
  schema:description """
	Facilitated by Julie McIsaac<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>January 30th - 3:00-5:00pm - ArtSpring Gallery <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Acclaimed artist Julie McIsaac works with participants to explore personal ancestry and family history as a creative starting point for performance. Through guided prompts, reflective exercises, and devising activities, participants will generate original material rooted in memory, story, and lived experience. Each participant will work towards sharing a few minutes of material by the end of the workshop. This workshop is welcoming to performers, writers, and curious creatives of all backgrounds. No prior devising experience is necessary, just an openness to explore personal stories through theatre. Register now to secure your spot in what is sure to be a moving and memorable experience.
""";
