<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/24001ABMNLGCGVMRMGTMJKPBQCNHQQLMH> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Viva Chorale! - Christmas in Cornwall";
  schema:description """
	Come celebrate the holiday season and support our local foodbank with Viva Chorale's annual holiday concert fundraiser!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This year the choir will sing carols interspersed with a lovely story from the UK: The Mousehole Cat. The tale follows the adventures of Mowzer the cat and her faithful human fisher, Tom Bawcock. This is a traditional story hailing from Cornwall, England. Every year to this day, the town of Mousehole celebrates this tale with a lantern festival and a seafood feast. This is a heartwarming story of bravery, courage and the desire to help. There will also be a sing along portion so you can join in the holiday music making - and there will be lots of holiday treats available too! Members of the foodbank will be present to write tax receipts for any donations.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All proceeds go to the foodbank. In addition to cash or cheques, food donations will also be gratefully accepted.
""";
  schema:startDate "2025-12-19T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/artspring/files/b86af2ee-d59a-42ae-96d4-cefeee67c6d7.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/artspring/location/403ASKCQMVCSKPPLNQMQPJVVSRPGMSKLR>;
  schema:offers _:6cfb468278f340539e63131aadaca0c98436;
  schema:duration "PT120M";
  schema:endDate "2025-12-19T21:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

