  schema:description """
	Join us for a wonderful opportunity to experience a professional ballet class with Ballet Kelowna. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Participating in a ballet class led by a professional ballet dancer/teacher is truly a gift to all of us who love ballet dancing. New insight and a deeper understanding of the ballet form nourish our bodies with new sensations of freedom, grace, and skill. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Pointe shoes are optional for this advanced class.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ballet Kelowna and ArtSpring are offering 2 community ballet workshops: <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sunday March 22nd | 3:00pm | Jr/Int/Adv Ballet Barre and Centre <span><br/></span>Sunday March 22nd | 4:15pm | Advanced learning Repertoire Price: $20/each or $35 for both classes. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Space is limited.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Location:<span><br/></span>Antler Ridge Dance studio<span><br/></span>211 Horel Rd W, Salt Spring Island, BC V8K 2A4<span><br/></span>240-537-6537
""";
