<http://www.spektrix.com/artspring/event/44801AVQJMVSBSCDMRGLRKNLTGJPHPNQG> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "WORKSHOP: LLOYD SPIEGEL";
  schema:description """
	Australian Bluesman Lloyd Spiegel returns to ArtSpring for a much requested concert - and this true showman and gifted musician will also be hosting a very special workshop, in which 30 guitarists can join Lloyd to learn alongside the best.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>UNLOCKING THE BLUES GUITAR<span><br/></span>What we love about our favourite guitarists is that their style is entirely unique. In this Blues guitar crash course, Lloyd Spiegel gives you the keys to unlock the fretboard and open doors to your personal Blues guitar journey through techniques, patterns, tips and tricks he’s picked up in his 30 years of performing. From soloing to finger-picking, speed to vibrato, Lloyd has you covered. All levels are welcome. No theory required.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-25T13:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
